        <span class="section-eyebrow">OUR GENESIS</span>
        <h2 class="about-section-heading">Crafted with Passion</h2>
        <p class="about-lead-paragraph">
          NIRALI was founded with a singular devotion: to celebrate the sacred poetry of the Indian saree and bring authentic, master-crafted textiles to the contemporary woman.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each drape in our archive is born from an intimate dialogue between time-honored heritage and modern design sensibilities. We work directly with master weaving clusters across Varanasi, Surat, Bengal, and Kanchipuram, safeguarding artisanal techniques passed down through generations.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believe luxury is not found in mass production, but in the patience of human hands, the whisper of pure silk, and the shimmer of authentic zari woven row by row.
        </p>
